    "en": "The authored rest elevation is 0.416 m long (tail tip at -0.175 m to nose at +0.241 m) and 0.262 m high, while dimensions say 0.21 m by 0.275 m, which describe the upright sitting pose; the volume follows the drawn rest shapes, so the x extent misses the 8 % gate by +98 % while the sitting pose measures 0.196 m by 0.281 m.",
